&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver roadmaps&lt;/strong&gt; that tie product direction to client goals and show real impact on performance, engagement, or growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Increase team efficiency and delivery velocity&lt;/strong&gt;, resulting in smoother cross-functional collaboration and more predictable, on-time project execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expand account value and longevity&lt;/strong&gt;, contributing to new workstreams and deeper client partnerships through demonstrated impact and trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve delivery consistency&lt;/strong&gt;, reducing delays, scope misalignment, and execution friction through scalable process enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position clients for future success&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating what&#39;s next and applying your expertise in CMS platforms and AI to shape innovative digital experiences and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You successfully deliver complex, CMS-based web projects for enterprise clients&lt;/strong&gt;, navigating scope, scale, and stakeholder expectations with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You build trust with clients as a primary point of contact&lt;/strong&gt;, providing clear guidance, managing escalations, and acting as a strategic partner throughout delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You proactively identify and resolve risks&lt;/strong&gt;, collaborating with teams and leadership to keep projects on track and outcomes intact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You lead cross-functional teams effectively&lt;/strong&gt;, aligning strategy, design, engineering, and QA to deliver high-quality results while maintaining team momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
