&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow existing clients&lt;/strong&gt; by expanding scope, deepening multi-threaded relationships, and moving accounts from one-off projects to recurring programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Win new clients&lt;/strong&gt; across foundation labs, emerging frontier labs, large tech companies building genAI products, and enterprises training or fine-tuning models for agentic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
