&lt;p&gt;Teams building genAI products and in-house models&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Domain-specific SFT/RLHF data, evals, embedded experts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enterprises&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Companies moving from buying AI to building or fine-tuning models for agentic workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proprietary-data fine-tuning, evaluation, trajectories for their own agents, staff aug&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Labs are the core of the business today; tech companies and enterprises are where the next wave of model-building revenue will come from. Enterprise accounts are run in partnership with Enterprise GTM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll sell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will sell a portfolio that spans our established services and the newer, more productized lines we are building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Offering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What labs buy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Where it is today&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RL environments and long-horizon agentic trajectories&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Environments, tasks, graders, and multi-step agent trajectories for reinforcement learning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Growth line; shaped closely with Product and Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RLHF / SFT&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expert-generated preference data, demonstrations, and evaluations for post-training&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Core revenue; scale and margin expansion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Staff augmentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vetted domain experts and specialists embedded with lab teams on W-2 or 1099 terms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New business unit; first deals and repeatable motion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data brokerage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Licensed and sourced datasets matched to lab training needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New revenue line; packaging, pricing, and first buyers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue and growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the model-builder revenue number across labs, tech companies, and enterprises: bookings, net revenue retention, and new-logo targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run the account plan for each key account, including whitespace mapping across all four offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source, scope, price, and close new programs; lead negotiations on MSAs, SOWs, and commercial terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accurately and run a disciplined pipeline that leadership can plan against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the senior relationship owner with research leads, post-training and AI platform teams, data leads, and procurement at each account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-thread every account so relationships do not depend on a single champion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run executive business reviews and turn delivery results into expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate and resolve delivery issues before they put renewals at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product and business transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring structured customer insight to Product and Engineering: what each segment is training on next, where data bottlenecks are, and what they will pay for.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-define packaging and pricing for productized offerings, moving revenue from bespoke services toward repeatable, higher-margin products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pilot new revenue lines (staff aug, data brokerage, agentic trajectories) with early-adopter clients and turn pilots into standard offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Delivery and Operations to make sure what is sold can be delivered at quality and margin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team and market&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a team of account executives and engagement leads as the business scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Invisible in the frontier AI community through conferences, research relationships, and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track competitors and market pricing, and feed that into positioning and strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 90 days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet the senior stakeholders at every active key account and have a written account plan for each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the model-builder pipeline and forecast across all three segments, with a clear view of expansion and new-logo targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close or advance at least one deal in a new revenue line (staff aug, data brokerage, or agentic trajectories).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agree with Product and Engineering on the top customer-driven priorities for the next two quarters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First year&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hit the model-builder revenue target, with growth from both existing and new accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measurably shift revenue mix toward productized, recurring offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Land new logos in each segment, including first enterprise model-building programs, and multi-thread every top account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a hired, ramped team running a repeatable sales motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in enterprise sales, business development, or account leadership, including 3+ years leading a team or a major book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing, senior relationships at one or more foundation or frontier AI labs, plus credibility with AI leaders at large tech companies or enterprises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of closing and expanding multi-million-dollar, multi-year deals with technical buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working fluency in how frontier models are built: pretraining, SFT, RLHF, RL environments, evals, and agentic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling a portfolio that blends services and technology, with strong commercial instincts on pricing, packaging, and margin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work cross-functionally with Product, Engineering, and Delivery to shape what gets built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior leadership at an AI data, training, or evaluation company, or on the data side of a frontier lab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking a services business toward productized or platform revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to staffing, talent marketplaces, or data licensing models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling AI/ML platforms or services into enterprises adopting agentic AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background (CS, ML, or a quantitative field).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Credible with researchers and enterprise buyers alike.&lt;/strong&gt; You can hold a credible conversation about reward models, eval design, and agent trajectories, not just commercial terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A builder, not just a closer.&lt;/strong&gt; You see a recurring customer need and push to turn it into &lt;strong&gt;a product.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity.&lt;/strong&gt; New offerings will be half-formed when you start selling &lt;strong&gt;them; you help shape them.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operationally rigorous.&lt;/strong&gt; Clean pipeline, honest forecasts, clear account plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Low ego, high ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You lead from the front on deals and give credit to the teams who deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s In It For You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Invisible is committed to fair and competitive pay, ensuring that compensation reflects both market conditions and the value each team member brings. Our salary structure accounts for regional differences in cost of living while maintaining internal equity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bonus and equity is included in all full-time, non commission offers. Final compensation is determined by a combination of factors, including location, job-related experience, skills, knowledge, internal pay equity, and overall market conditions. Because of this, every offer is unique. Additional details on total compensation and benefits will be discussed during the hiring process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can find more information about our geographic pay tiers&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://invisibletech.ai/compensation-and-pay-tiers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://invisibletech.ai/compensation-and-pay-tiers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; During the interview process, your Invisible Talent Acquisition Partner will confirm which tier applies to your location. For candidates outside the U.S., compensation is adjusted to reflect local market conditions and cost of living.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What It&#39;s Like to Work at Invisible:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;At Invisible, we’re not just redefining work—we’re reinventing it. We operate at the intersection of advanced AI and human ingenuity, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible to unlock productivity and scale. Ownership is at the core of everything we do. Here, you won’t just execute tasks—you’ll build, innovate, and shape the future alongside world-class clients pushing the boundaries of AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;We expect bold ideas, relentless drive, and the ability to turn ambiguity into opportunity. The pace is fast, the challenges are big, and the growth is unmatched. We’re not for everyone, and we’re okay with that. If you’re looking for predictable routines, this isn’t the place for you. But if you’re driven to create, thrive in dynamic environments, and want a front-row seat to the AI revolution, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;Invisible is a hybrid organization with offices and team members located around the world. While some roles may offer remote flexibility, most positions involve in-office collaboration and are tied to specific locations. Any location-based requirements or hybrid expectations will be communicated by our Talent Acquisition team during the recruiting process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;AI Interviewing Guidelines:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Our hiring team thoughtfully uses AI to support an efficient, engaging, and inclusive interview process. Since AI can also be a helpful tool for candidates, we&#39;ve outlined expectations for using it ethically throughout your interview journey.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.invisible.co/ai-interview-guidelines&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.invisible.co/ai-interview-guidelines&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Click here to learn more about how we use AI and our guidelines for candidates.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Accessibility Statement:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(52, 73, 94);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations for individuals with disabilities. If you require an accommodation to participate in the application or interview process, please submit your request using our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation request form.&lt;/a&gt; A member of our team will follow up to support your request.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Invisible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Invisible is an Applied AI research company closing the gap between frontier models and the enterprise. We provide the platform infrastructure that makes AI work in production at scale: unify fragmented data, map complex processes, orchestrate and evaluate agents, and stand up hyper-personalized workflow applications fast for companies like Grubhub, Alliance Global, and Thomson Reuters. Where models fall short, we build RL environments and data to fix them. The result: a virtuous cycle between enterprise deployment and model training.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Recognized as Best Predictive Analytics Platform of the Year at the 2026 AI Breakthrough Awards, Invisible makes AI work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Data Scientist, you&#39;ll work directly with clients and our internal delivery teams to build and deploy AI-powered solutions that transform how work gets done. You’ll own projects end-to-end: scoping ambiguous problems, prototyping AI workflows, and deploying scalable data science solutions on top of our products — all while interfacing with technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role: equal parts data scientist and technical consultant. It&#39;s perfect for someone who wants to be hands-on with data science and close to the impact they generate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with delivery leaders to scope, develop, and deploy end-to-end statistical and ML solutions to operational problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dig into customer problems to identify optimizations, then turn them into stable, scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate messy real-world constraints (e.g., inconsistent data, latency requirements) into elegant solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iterate quickly based on real-time feedback from operators and clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable tooling and infrastructure that accelerates future model development and deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of hands-on experience in data science, through professional roles, internships, or coursework/research projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Data Science, Computer Science, or a related field, or equivalent professional experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python skills and familiarity with libraries like NumPy, Pandas, scikit-learn, TensorFlow, and PyTorch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of statistical modeling end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills — you can explain data decisions to non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset and comfort working in fast-moving, unstructured environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to be on-call for our customers when situations arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s In It For You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Invisible is committed to fair and competitive pay, ensuring that compensation reflects both market conditions and the value each team member brings. Our salary structure accounts for regional differences in cost of living while maintaining internal equity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual salary range for this position, depending on level, is: &lt;strong&gt;$122,000 - $199,000 USD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bonus and equity is included in all full-time, non commission offers. Final compensation is determined by a combination of factors, including location, job-related experience, skills, knowledge, internal pay equity, and overall market conditions. Because of this, every offer is unique. Additional details on total compensation and benefits will be discussed during the hiring process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can find more information about our geographic pay tiers&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://invisibletech.ai/compensation-and-pay-tiers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://invisibletech.ai/compensation-and-pay-tiers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; During the interview process, your Invisible Talent Acquisition Partner will confirm which tier applies to your location. For candidates outside the U.S., compensation is adjusted to reflect local market conditions and cost of living.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What It&#39;s Like to Work at Invisible:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;At Invisible, we’re not just redefining work—we’re reinventing it. We operate at the intersection of advanced AI and human ingenuity, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible to unlock productivity and scale. Ownership is at the core of everything we do. Here, you won’t just execute tasks—you’ll build, innovate, and shape the future alongside world-class clients pushing the boundaries of AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;We expect bold ideas, relentless drive, and the ability to turn ambiguity into opportunity. The pace is fast, the challenges are big, and the growth is unmatched. We’re not for everyone, and we’re okay with that. If you’re looking for predictable routines, this isn’t the place for you. But if you’re driven to create, thrive in dynamic environments, and want a front-row seat to the AI revolution, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;Invisible is a hybrid organization with offices and team members located around the world. While some roles may offer remote flexibility, most positions involve in-office collaboration and are tied to specific locations. Any location-based requirements or hybrid expectations will be communicated by our Talent Acquisition team during the recruiting process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;AI Interviewing Guidelines:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Our hiring team thoughtfully uses AI to support an efficient, engaging, and inclusive interview process. Since AI can also be a helpful tool for candidates, we&#39;ve outlined expectations for using it ethically throughout your interview journey.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.invisible.co/ai-interview-guidelines&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.invisible.co/ai-interview-guidelines&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Click here to learn more about how we use AI and our guidelines for candidates.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Accessibility Statement:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(52, 73, 94);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations for individuals with disabilities. If you require an accommodation to participate in the application or interview process, please submit your request using our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation request form.&lt;/a&gt; A member of our team will follow up to support your request.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

