&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Invisible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Invisible is an Applied AI research company closing the gap between frontier models and the enterprise. We provide the platform infrastructure that makes AI work in production at scale: unify fragmented data, map complex processes, orchestrate and evaluate agents, and stand up hyper-personalized workflow applications fast for companies like Grubhub, Alliance Global, and Thomson Reuters. Where models fall short, we build RL environments and data to fix them. The result: a virtuous cycle between enterprise deployment and model training.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Recognized as Best Predictive Analytics Platform of the Year at the 2026 AI Breakthrough Awards, Invisible makes AI work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager of Strategic Staffing owns end-to-end recruiting delivery for high-volume, client-facing staffing engagements. You will build and run the hiring engine behind large staff augmentation programs, from forecasting and sourcing through offer, onboarding handoff, and backfill. You will lead a team of recruiters and coordinators, own fill-rate and time-to-fill commitments, and act as the client&#39;s primary talent partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role for someone who has scaled hiring at, or in close partnership with, a staffing agency or staff augmentation firm and is comfortable being accountable to client SLAs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full recruiting lifecycle for assigned client programs: workforce forecasting, requisition intake, sourcing, screening, interviewing, offers, and start-date readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate client headcount plans and SLAs into a hiring plan with weekly targets, pipeline ratios, and recruiter capacity models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, and coach a team of recruiters, sourcers, and coordinators, including contract recruiters during peak ramps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the client-facing talent lead: run weekly hiring reviews, report on fill rate and time-to-fill, and escalate risks early with a mitigation plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design high-volume processes, such as assessment screening, group interviews, hiring events, and automated scheduling, that keep quality steady at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage sourcing channels and spend, including job boards, referral programs, agencies, community partnerships, and talent pools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Operations, Training, and Workforce Management to align start dates with training classes and backfill attrition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own recruiting data in the ATS and dashboards; use funnel metrics to diagnose drop-off and improve conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with employment law, background check, and drug-screen requirements, plus client-specific onboarding rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new-business efforts by contributing hiring plans, staffing timelines, and cost estimates to proposals and RFPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agency experience is required: you have worked at a staffing agency, staff augmentation firm, RPO, or have worked directly with agency partners to deliver client hiring programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in recruiting, including 3+ years as a Senior Manager or above.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of delivering 200+ hires within a single program or quarter against client SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading recruiting teams of 4 or more, including remote and contract recruiters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client management skills: you&#39;ve owned the talent relationship with enterprise accounts and presented hiring performance to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with recruiting metrics (fill rate, time-to-fill, submittal-to-hire, offer acceptance, 90-day retention) and comfort building capacity models in spreadsheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with an enterprise ATS and high-volume tools such as assessments, chatbots, and automated scheduling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of US employment law, I-9/E-Verify, background screening, and multi-state hiring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to staffing RFPs or proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in BPO, contact center, or customer support hiring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with bilingual or multi-site hiring programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
