&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;● Recruiter conversation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;● Interview with the hiring executive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;●&amp;nbsp;Interviews with executive and cross-functional leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
