&lt;h4&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cast AI, our People team plays a key role in our success. We’re a small, high-performing team working in a fast-growing SaaS company across multiple regions. As we continue to expand globally, we’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Talent Acquisition Partner (Embedded)&lt;/strong&gt; to help us hire great people and build strong teams. You’ll work closely with leaders in Engineering, Product, Sales, and Marketing to support our growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an embedded, contract-based engagement — you’ll join as a dedicated contractor rather than a permanent employee, and the length of the engagement is open-ended, tied to our hiring needs rather than a fixed term.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Based in Europe, with 4+ years of end-to-end recruitment experience, ideally within a high-growth SaaS or tech start-up environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven track record of hiring for both technical roles (Engineering, Product, Data) and GTM functions (Sales, Marketing, Customer Success) on an international scale across EMEA, AMER, and APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced, ambiguous environment where priorities shift and speed matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Applicant Tracking Systems (Greenhouse or similar platforms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with modern recruitment practices, including the use of AI tools to streamline sourcing, screening, and candidate engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Solutions-oriented with strong stakeholder management skills and the ability to push back and influence where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrated commitment to attracting diverse talent and creating an inclusive hiring experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal English communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with hiring managers across Tech and Go-to-Market functions to understand hiring needs and translate them into effective recruiting strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Manage end-to-end recruitment across all stages, from job briefing to offer stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Leverage a variety of sourcing techniques and tools, including AI-powered recruitment solutions, to attract diverse, top-tier talent across EMEA, AMER, and APAC markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to hiring teams, coaching them on best practices, structured interviewing, and candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Contribute to building scalable hiring processes and staying ahead of industry trends to keep our recruitment approach sharp and competitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation (€4000 - €5000 gross, depending on the level of experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, remote-first way of working — plug into a global team from wherever you are based in Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to work on a genuinely interesting product: Cast AI sits at the center of how modern companies run Kubernetes and AI infrastructure, giving you exposure to cutting-edge cloud-native technology and the people building it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full immersion in the team you support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to international, high-growth hiring — sourcing and closing talent across EMEA, AMER, and APAC for a company that just crossed unicorn status.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
