&lt;h4&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;San Francisco is where cloud-native gets built. The engineering teams running the biggest Kubernetes and AI workloads in the world sit within a few miles of each other, and every one of them is wrestling with the same problem: infrastructure that grows faster than humans can tune it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s the conversation you&#39;ll own. As an Enterprise Account Executive in the Bay Area, you&#39;ll sell to CTOs, VPs of Engineering, and FinOps leaders at companies where cloud spend is a board-level topic and automation is the only answer that scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re in build mode across the Americas. You won&#39;t be inheriting a tidy territory and a playbook to follow - you&#39;ll be sourcing your own pipeline, shaping how we win enterprise deals in the most competitive tech market there is, and helping define what excellence looks like for our US go-to-market. If you&#39;re an entrepreneurial seller who wants a product that genuinely sells itself once the right people see it, this is the seat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What&#39;ll You Own?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Absolute ownership of building and sourcing sustainable pipeline coverage across your Bay Area territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running complex, multi-threaded enterprise deals from first conversation to close, with confident, accurate forecasting to plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting Opportunity Assessments to focus on viable, high-quality opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading Value Discovery to align Cast AI with each client&#39;s needs, and demonstrating the unique value of the platform effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mapping, navigating, and aligning key stakeholders across Engineering, IT, Finance, and Procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring Value Delivery through careful implementation and measurement of results, alongside Customer Success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What&#39;ll You Need?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: based in the San Francisco Bay Area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record as an enterprise Account Executive, consistently closing large, complex deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience running deals with MEDDPICC or a comparable sales qualification methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in Opportunity Assessment, Value Discovery, Value Demonstration, and Value Delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate multi-threaded deals involving CTOs, VPs of Engineering, and FinOps leaders at the same time, including running executive business reviews, leading technical discovery, and building champions across IT, Finance, and Procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to translate complex technical products (cloud infrastructure, DevOps, platform engineering) into clear business ROI narratives, including business cases, ROI calculators, and executive-level proposals tailored to each account&#39;s cloud spend and engineering maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration with Sales Engineering, Customer Success, and Marketing, plus rigorous pipeline hygiene: accurate forecasting, CRM discipline, and the confidence to present pipeline reviews to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of identifying key contacts, understanding client needs, and tailoring proposals to match, with demonstrated success in negotiation and closing and a commitment to long-term customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An outbound obsession.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder&#39;s mindset: you bring solutions, not problems, and want to help build excellence in the Americas GTM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What Makes You Stand Out?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling cloud SaaS in Cloud Infrastructure, Cloud Cost Control, Cloud Security, or DevOps tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with Kubernetes and the cloud-native ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a fast-growing company at the forefront of cloud-native automation and Kubernetes technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, remote-first global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) retirement plan with 100% company match on employee contributions up to 6% of pay (available after 3 months of employment).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UnitedHealthcare plans including medical, dental, and vision coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning budget for your professional and personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-building budget and company events to connect with your colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
