&lt;p&gt;Designing for Cast AI isn&#39;t just about aesthetics. It&#39;s about tackling technical challenges and understanding how things are wired at the backend. With a platform built for DevOps and engineers, technical awareness is crucial. To create intuitive experiences, you&#39;ll need to immerse yourself in the technology, learning how complex systems interact and making them more accessible through thoughtful design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a location-specific opportunity. We are currently accepting applications from candidates residing in the following European countries: &lt;strong&gt;Bulgaria, Croatia, Estonia, Greece, Hungary, Latvia, Lithuania, Poland, Romania, Slovakia, Slovenia, and Ukraine&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
