&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced environment, responding agilely to evolving project requirements and tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide and seek feedback from fellow designers and cross-functional team members (design, engineering, product, sales) to foster continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
