&lt;h4&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;17&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba577895d33c&quot;&gt;Kimchi is building products at the frontier of how engineering organizations adopt and operate AI — across AI coding and agents, inference, model orchestration, governance, and the infrastructure that makes all of it work reliably at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;259&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9b222cce7bbb&quot;&gt;This is a highly dynamic space. Customer expectations, technology capabilities, competitors, and even the problems worth solving are changing quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;411&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3df998f02882&quot;&gt;That means we’re looking for a Senior Product Manager who is exceptionally good at working before the problem is well defined.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;539&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b25d3a21c5d2&quot;&gt;You won’t inherit a neat backlog of customer requirements and execute against it. You’ll be expected to explore emerging problem spaces, talk to customers, understand technology shifts, connect weak signals, form hypotheses, and decide which problems are important enough for Kimchi to solve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;833&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9cc9bbd4b517&quot;&gt;A large part of the job is turning ambiguity into clarity while operating in a dynamic greenfield environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;945&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a5f7acb7e3eb&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with engineering, design, customers, and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;GTM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to take promising opportunities from an initial insight through validation, 0→1 product development, adoption, and iteration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3305&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a6675c3364f0&quot;&gt;Significant experience owning software products end-to-end, with the judgment and independence expected from a Senior Product Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3443&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4d89bfb276e1&quot;&gt;Strong 0→1 experience. You have personally taken products or significant product areas from an unclear opportunity through discovery, validation, launch, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3615&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d50d0cbf82d6&quot;&gt;A track record of navigating ambiguity. You can give examples where neither the problem nor the solution was obvious at the beginning and explain how you created clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3789&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ca85e30464ef&quot;&gt;Excellent problem selection and product judgment. You don’t just solve problems well; you are deliberate about deciding which problems are worth solving in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3965&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e58b3d09167d&quot;&gt;Experience working in greenfield, rapidly changing, or emerging domains where information is incomplete and plans frequently need to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4109&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a89f1d755cdd&quot;&gt;Strong customer discovery skills. You can go beyond what customers ask for and uncover the underlying problem, context, and behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4246&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8f7387c3ce78&quot;&gt;Strong analytical thinking. You are comfortable combining qualitative evidence, product data, market signals, and technical constraints to make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4404&quot; data-local-id=&quot;100d832d45d0&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal communication. You can simplify complex topics without oversimplifying the underlying problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4528&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1089d69f1b6f&quot;&gt;Experience working closely with highly technical engineering teams and enough technical curiosity to understand the systems you are building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4673&quot; data-local-id=&quot;471f37623e36&quot;&gt;A bias toward experimentation and learning rather than large upfront plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4752&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1901287c419d&quot;&gt;Comfort making decisions with imperfect information and changing your mind when new evidence emerges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4857&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2499a56bc0b5&quot;&gt;Hands-on use of modern AI tools in your own work. You should be actively exploring how LLMs and agents change both the products we build and the way product work itself gets done.&lt;/li&gt;
