&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1646&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f06b45d235f5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Validate before scaling.&lt;/strong&gt; Find the fastest way to test whether a problem matters and whether our proposed solution creates meaningful value. Be equally comfortable investing further or killing an idea when the evidence says we should.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1883&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e526464a71cc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Make hard prioritization decisions.&lt;/strong&gt; There will always be more interesting opportunities than we can pursue. You’ll decide what deserves attention now, what can wait, and what we should deliberately not build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2095&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3d816907e8f6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Work directly with customers.&lt;/strong&gt; Run discovery, observe workflows, understand underlying motivations and constraints, and distinguish individual requests from broader problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2272&quot; data-local-id=&quot;542f2d7f75d0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Partner deeply with engineering and design.&lt;/strong&gt; Shape solutions collaboratively. Understand enough of the technology to explore possibilities and trade-offs with strong technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2457&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9614e540aabc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Define what success means.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish the customer and business outcomes we expect, determine how to measure them, and use evidence to guide subsequent decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2622&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ed080bcc071e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Drive adoption, not just launches.&lt;/strong&gt; Stay accountable after something ships. Understand whether customers are discovering it, using it repeatedly, getting value from it, and why.&lt;/li&gt;
