&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;19a11577-720c-48ba-96d8-5d8d362c3c3d&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience designing CLI or terminal-based interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;53e35203-0c09-4500-b98d-3922504767d6&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Familiarity with desktop app design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;93dbacc0-629a-493d-b1a8-ab38e93dfcc4&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience presenting design and research findings directly to executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;518476f6-573e-4333-8aec-6a28373a3c06&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Own problems end-to-end across the Kimchi surface — CLI, desktop app, inference/spend console, or developer tooling — from research through shipped design and measured outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;f0d36f0b-eef6-4fc1-a652-dcc6f5a31454&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Lead user research initiatives independently: plan them, run them, synthesize them, and turn findings into a case for what the product should do next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;fbe3baba-f115-45db-be89-2753ccf76021&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Prototype in code where it&#39;s faster than Figma — using AI-assisted workflows to test ideas directly in the product rather than only in mockups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;8fdbbee7-8d93-4961-9c8f-b560a0456c42&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Bring a point of view to product strategy conversations, backed by direct product usage, research evidence, and competitor awareness — not just execution of a roadmap handed to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;aed7f579-7561-4b3a-a12f-e9bf8adf4410&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Participate in cross-squad design reviews to catch overlap early, raise the quality bar, and stay aware of what other Kimchi designers are building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;3de50ab1-4a68-4f4b-97d9-2e210515ad35&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Track design debt in your area and push to prioritize it when risk factors or user feedback make it urgent.&lt;/li&gt;
